(function(){var C=window.__CLIPS||(window.__CLIPS={});var d={"Press Begin when you are ready.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Worked example.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Yes.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not quite yet. Have another look, or use a hint.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not quite yet. That's fine. You can try again, or move on without an answer.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Choose an answer first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Type your answer first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Put all of them in order first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sort all of them first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You explored new possibilities.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "New idea explored.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You worked through something difficult.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Challenge explored.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You stayed with the challenge.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Strong persistence.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You tried a different approach when your first idea did not work.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "New strategy discovered.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You kept trying.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Learning continued.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You looked carefully before deciding.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Careful observation.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Dealing with conflict.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Today I am practising calm ways to sort out disagreements.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What is conflict?.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Conflict is a disagreement or fight between people. It happens at home and at school. It is normal, but how we deal with it matters.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Steps to sort it out.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Stop and calm down. Say how you feel using I statements. Listen to the other person. Find a solution together. Ask a grown-up for help if you need it.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Two friends both want the same swing. What could they do?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Stop and stay calm, without pushing.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Each says what they want: \"I really want a turn.\"": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Agree on a solution: take turns, for example counting to 50 each.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Which is an \"I statement\"?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "\"I feel sad when you take my pencil.\"": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "\"You always take my things!\"": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "\"Give it back now!\"": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "\"You're mean.\"": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "An I statement starts with \"I feel…\".": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It talks about your feeling, not blaming.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Which one sounds calm?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "\"I feel sad when…\" explains your feeling without blaming.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Put the steps for sorting out conflict in order.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You need to be calm before talking.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Then each person speaks and listens.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The solution comes last.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Calm down, say how you feel, listen, then find a solution together.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sort these responses to conflict.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Helpful responses solve the problem safely.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Does it make things better or worse?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Hitting and name-calling make things worse.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Taking turns, talking and asking for help are helpful. Hitting, name-calling and ignoring for ever are not.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sipho bumps into Ayanda and her tower falls. Sipho didn't mean it. What could Ayanda do?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Take a breath and say, \"Please be careful. Can you help me rebuild it?\"": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Knock down Sipho's tower": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Shout at Sipho": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Never speak to Sipho again": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It was an accident.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Which answer is calm and helps solve it?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Asking for help to fix it is a solution.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Calmly explaining and asking for help turns the accident into teamwork.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "How can you avoid some conflicts before they start?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Share, take turns and speak kindly": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Always win": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Never play with others": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Take what you want": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Many conflicts are about sharing and turns.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Kind words help.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Which answer prevents problems?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sharing, taking turns and kind words prevent many conflicts.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Which step would help you most?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Calming down first": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Using an I statement": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Listening": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not sure": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Calm words solve more problems than angry ones.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Conflict. a disagreement between people.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "I statement. saying how you feel, starting with \"I feel\".": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Solution. a way to fix a problem.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,"};for(var k in d)C[k]=d[k];})();
